	spec: 'SYSTEM.md tells the model, in one sentence, to link an image as a plain URL. With webUrl configured (${web_url}, from settings) it is ${web_url}/image/<name>; otherwise http://localhost:${web_port}/image/<name>. The address comes from template variables, so the tracked file holds no private host name and the model never asks the user for it or writes Markdown bracket links.',
